        "leaf": "260928-MIK-L39"
      },
      "rationale": "The options of a selection. Without `keepTree` a selection starts the tree afresh, so every caller that passes no options is an outside selection.",
      "role": "support"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "00b6a54df559165d59f5c46c8a1ab31d6701367a",
        "content": "sha256:0c33f4ff9cc589138ae44e6d02cf8d3b6f851239b6b87f359d3b3a0a9c62a0aa",
        "locator": {
          "kind": "symbol",
          "name": "CatalogueFamilies"
        }
      },
      "id": "RLZ-534RCM",
      "invariant": "INV-9ZKYWQ",
      "origin": {
        "handoffEntry": "MIK-R39@v1-other-selections-start-afresh",
        "leaf": "260928-MIK-L39"
      },
      "rationale": "Places the tree, as one keyed child, where the first family it shows stands in the catalogue. While the tree holds a kept family it also lists a catalogue row for every family the tree shows. A catalogue row selects without options, which starts the tree afresh with that family alone. The case \"starts afresh at the family row of the subject already selected\" of `dashboard/src/panels/review/ReviewSurface.walkFresh.test.tsx` tests a row that names the selected subject.",
      "role": "presentation"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "00b6a54df559165d59f5c46c8a1ab31d6701367a",
        "content": "sha256:9413f7df828e707acd31a1c8799e2cd20451930fbd8dd55086d2ab09cef28501",
        "locator": {
          "kind": "symbol",
          "name": "useReviewNavigation"
        }
      },
      "id": "RLZ-CCAZC6N3",
      "invariant": "INV-115RDW8H",
      "origin": {
        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L46"
      },
      "rationale": "Is where the reviewer reads the catalogue once on entry, through useReviewCatalogue keyed on this comparison, and picks the initial subject from it. It holds the review read as settling only until the catalogue answers or SUBJECT_HOLD_MS expires, so the review is asked for just the subject the catalogue chose; a new snapshot pair for the same comparison bumps the generation and re-keys the read.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "00b6a54df559165d59f5c46c8a1ab31d6701367a",
        "content": "sha256:9ab07617d668d06418fea3d3b6c2381aaf882d9e8e0904d135fe0ea1fa723623",
        "locator": {
          "kind": "symbol",
          "name": "useReaderEngagement"
        }
      },
      "id": "RLZ-MTG17Z99",
      "invariant": "INV-RMTHRQ0K",
      "origin": {
        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L48"
      },
      "rationale": "Observes the reader's gestures passively on the surface root and reports them to engage; it handles no event itself.",
      "role": "support"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "00b6a54df559165d59f5c46c8a1ab31d6701367a",
        "content": "sha256:26cf22d37531dad22a1d29776e25369192889e02820270e33cc11aac1de5a895",
